    <h1>Professional Programme Proposals</h1>
    <p class="lead">We welcome proposals directly related to the arts, especially those with creative ideas for our spaces or that connect the campus with the wider community.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="container page-body">
  <div class="call-summary">
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Status</dt><dd><span class="tag tag--open">Open</span></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Open period</dt><dd>1 Oct – 1 Nov 2026</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Who can apply</dt><dd>Professional companies or individual artists</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Dates</dt><dd>As announced each season</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#docs">Download the proposal form <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"/></svg></a>
  </div>
  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Ways to partner</h2>
        <div class="option-grid">
          <div class="opt"><h3>A　Presented by the Center</h3><p>At The Odeum, Youxin Theatre or another campus arts venue. The Center covers the main costs and coordinates the production.</p></div>
          <div class="opt"><h3>B　Co-presented</h3><p>At the same venues. Costs and responsibilities are agreed between both parties; see the full guidelines.</p></div>
        </div>
        <h2>How to apply</h2>
        <ol><li>Download and complete the proposal form.</li><li>During the open period, email the form and your proposal with the subject “Professional Proposal”.</li><li>We will let you know the outcome after review.</li></ol>
